{title: Tor Moner Pinjiray}
{artist: Jisan Khan}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Jar karone charlam ami [D]jogot songsar,        [Bm]Tobuo se pashan bondhu [C]hoilo na amar
[Em]Amar dukkhe kande akash [D]kande re jomin
[Bm]Nidoya tui pashan bondhu [C]eto re kothin
[Em]Tor moner pinjiray tui [Am]kare dili thai,        [D]Kare eto korli apon [Bm]por kore [Em]amaye
[Em]Tui valo thakis bondhu amar,        [Am]Sukhe thakis roj Tor [Bm]swopne ami
ashbo thiki [C]Nite tor [Em]khuj.        [Em]Jole nebhey jonaki [Am]diye jay alo
[D]Tui chara ekla ami [Bm]kemne thaki [Em]bhalo,        [Em]E bhora jochonay [Am]tui kar pashey
[D]Kar bukhete matha rakhis,        [Bm]kare bhalo [Em]beshe
[Em]Tor moner pinjiray tui [Am]kare dili thai,        [D]Kare eto korli apon [Bm]por kore [Em]amaye
[Em]Tui valo thakis bondhu amar,        [Am]Sukhe thakis roj Tor [Bm]swopne
ami ashbo thiki [C]Nite tor [Em]khuj.
[Em]Ei ronger duniaye amar [Am]chawar kichui nai,
[D]Roj hasore chaibo tore [Bm]khodar [Em]khajanay,        [Em]Tokhon jodi hay [Am]tore na pai
[D]Nijer jibon britha bhabo [Bm]korar kichu [Em]nai
[Em]Tor moner pinjiray tui [Am]kare dili thai,        [D]Kare eto korli apon [Bm]por kore [Em]amaye
[Em]Tui valo thakis bondhu amar,        [Am]Sukhe thakis roj Tor
[Bm]swopne ami ashbo thiki [C]Nite tor [Em]khuj.
